{"unit_id":"SUJIElearning__zhaoyu-restart#feature-1","repo":"SUJIElearning/zhaoyu-restart","commit":"a31c5a8492c7acf8c2f83ae014a785d6637ffc3f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"昭瑜的一键重启插件的功能「输入框重启按钮」：在网页聊天输入框左侧显示重启按钮。点击后按钮进入重启中状态，并向主机端发送 POST 请求；收到失败响应或网络错误时恢复按钮。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:14-21","lib/client.js:51-67"]}
{"unit_id":"SUJIElearning__zhaoyu-restart#feature-2","repo":"SUJIElearning/zhaoyu-restart","commit":"a31c5a8492c7acf8c2f83ae014a785d6637ffc3f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"昭瑜的一键重启插件的功能「主机脚本重启」：主机端接受 POST /zhaoyu-restart 请求，并通过 subprocess 服务以隐藏的 PowerShell 启动所配置的重启脚本，返回启动结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49-89"]}
{"unit_id":"SUJIElearning__zhaoyu-restart#feature-3","repo":"SUJIElearning/zhaoyu-restart","commit":"a31c5a8492c7acf8c2f83ae014a785d6637ffc3f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"昭瑜的一键重启插件的功能「脚本路径设置」：通过 zhaoyu-restart 设置命名空间配置 scriptPath；未提供有效值时使用代码内的默认 Windows 批处理脚本路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-23","lib/index.js:30-40","lib/index.js:42-45"]}
{"unit_id":"SUJIElearning__zhaoyu-restart#caveat-1","repo":"SUJIElearning/zhaoyu-restart","commit":"a31c5a8492c7acf8c2f83ae014a785d6637ffc3f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"昭瑜的一键重启插件 使用前须知：主机使用 powershell.exe 启动配置脚本；默认路径为 Windows .bat 文件，需设置为本机可用路径。（见 lib/index.js:17-23、68-76）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-23","lib/index.js:68-76"]}
